<title>FRANCE: Eramet to raise stake in Comilog.</title>
<headline>Eramet to raise stake in Comilog.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eramet said on Wednesday that it had reached an agreement to acquire a 15 percent stake in Comilog from Gencor for 226 million francs.</p>
<p>The transaction, if approved by Eramet shareholders, would increase Eramet's stake in Comilog to 61 percent.</p>
<p>Comilog operates a large manganese field in Moanda, Gabon.</p>
<p>In a statement Eramet said it would pay Gencor with bonds convertible into Eramet shares.</p>
<p>Gencor would control around four percent of Eramet capital if it decides to exercise all the bonds.</p>
<p>The bonds can otherwise be reimbursed three years after issuing date.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432 dom/bfl</p>
</text>
